            <title>0.1.13</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:13:52 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/maxibenner/exec</link>
            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Features
- Added syntax highlighting for markdown code-blocks.
- Updated the image generation tool to allow editing through reference images
- Added client-side compaction for providers without dedicated endpoints.
- Updated OpenAI model catalog to enable Astra and Sol 6.2.

## Fixes
- Session title wouldn't auto populate the rename input field after renaming for the first time.
- Enabled hosts's screenshot functionality for sessions created from the iOS app.
]]></description>
